#%RAML 0.8
title: OneThing API
version: 1.0.0
documentation:
- title: OneThing API
  content: |
    OneThing turns a photo, a link or a picked product into a live one-product shop that takes

    PayPal payments, or a recommendation page that earns referral commissions through Channel3.


    **How a shop is made**

    1. `createShop`: start from a photo, a link, or a Channel3 product. Gemini guesses what it
       is, how it's delivered, the price, a short link and the page design. You get back the
       shop's link name and an **admin token**.
    2. `updateShop`: correct anything the AI guessed, then set `status: live`.

    3. Buyers pay on `https://<host>/<slug>` with PayPal. Sellers read orders and ship them.


    **Auth.** Seller endpoints take the shop's admin token in the `x-admin-token` header, or a

    **platform API key** (`Authorization: Bearer ot_sk_…`) for marketplaces that make shops for

    their own sellers. Buyer endpoints (checkout, access-code verification, downloads) are public.


    **Access codes.** A digital product can unlock an app or game instead of shipping a file.

    Each paid order gets a code such as `K7QF-M2XP-9HTD`; your app calls `verifyAccessCode`

    before unlocking. Raptor Rush on miriogames.com is a live example.


    **Agent-ready.** Every live shop is also published for AI shopping agents: an MCP server at

    `/api/mcp` with `search_shops`, `get_product`, `create_order` and `get_order`, and the same

    four as plain GETs for assistants that can only fetch URLs (`listAgentShops`,

    `getAgentProduct`, `orderByLink`, `getAgentOrder`), with `/llms.txt` as the starting point.

    Order and status links also have short forms, `/<slug>/buy` and `/o/<order_id>/status`.

    An agent can find and order, but the buyer still approves every payment at PayPal.


    **Limits.** Calls that cost something are capped per network: 120 checkouts per 10 minutes,

    10 new shops an hour and 60 AI requests an hour. Over the cap the reply is a 429 with

    `Retry-After`.


    All money moves through PayPal (sandbox in this deployment). OneThing never holds card data.
baseUri: https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com
securedBy: []
protocols:
- HTTPS
- HTTP
baseUriParameters: {}
schemas:
- ErrorResponse: |
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
      "id": "ErrorResponse",
      "title": "ErrorResponse",
      "description": "An error reply.",
      "example": {
        "error": "Choose a photo.",
        "field": "photo"
      },
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "error": {
          "description": "A sentence you can show to a person.",
          "example": "Order not found.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "field": {
          "description": "The form field at fault, when there is one.",
          "example": "price",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "detail": {
          "description": "The upstream service's own message, for debugging.",
          "example": "INSTRUMENT_DECLINED",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "error"
      ]
    }
- CreateShopForm: |
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
      "id": "CreateShopForm",
      "title": "CreateShopForm",
      "description": "What to make a shop from. Only `source` is required; the AI guesses the rest and the seller corrects it with `updateShop`.",
      "example": {
        "source": "photo",
        "description": "Vintage cream and red quad roller skates with walnut burl heels.",
        "url": "https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates",
        "productId": "ch3_7f2a9c1e",
        "slug": "vintageskates",
        "type": "auto",
        "delivery": "file",
        "access_url": "https://www.miriogames.com/raptor-rush/",
        "price": 240,
        "shipping": 15,
        "stock": 7,
        "ship_countries": "US",
        "paypal_email": "seller@example.com",
        "seller_email": "seller@example.com"
      },
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "source": {
          "title": "Source",
          "description": "What the shop starts from: a photo (with an optional description), a product link, or a Channel3 product to recommend.",
          "example": "photo",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "photo",
            "link",
            "channel3"
          ]
        },
        "photo": {
          "description": "`source=photo`: the product photo, up to 8 MB.",
          "type": "string",
          "format": "data-url"
        },
        "description": {
          "description": "`source=photo`: a sentence or two about the product. Required if there is no photo.",
          "example": "Vintage cream and red quad roller skates with walnut burl heels.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "url": {
          "description": "`source=link`: a product page, or your own app or game page.",
          "example": "https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates",
          "type": "string",
          "format": "uri"
        },
        "productId": {
          "description": "`source=channel3`: a product id from `searchProducts`.",
          "example": "ch3_7f2a9c1e",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "slug": {
          "description": "The link name you want. If omitted, the AI suggests one.",
          "example": "vintageskates",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "title": "Type",
          "description": "`physical` ships, `digital` is a file or an access code, `auto` lets the AI decide.",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "auto",
            "physical",
            "digital"
          ]
        },
        "delivery": {
          "title": "Delivery",
          "description": "For digital products. If omitted, the AI guesses.",
          "example": "file",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "file",
            "access_code"
          ]
        },
        "access_url": {
          "description": "Where buyers use an access code.",
          "example": "https://www.miriogames.com/raptor-rush/",
          "type": "string",
          "format": "uri"
        },
        "price": {
          "description": "USD. If omitted, the AI suggests a price.",
          "example": 240,
          "type": "number"
        },
        "shipping": {
          "description": "Physical products: shipping per order, in USD. If omitted, the AI suggests it.",
          "example": 15,
          "type": "number"
        },
        "stock": {
          "description": "How many are for sale. Leave out for unlimited.",
          "example": 7,
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32"
        },
        "ship_countries": {
          "description": "Physical products: comma-separated ISO country codes to ship to. Empty means anywhere PayPal ships.",
          "examples": [
            {
              "Id": "Untitled Example1",
              "Name": null,
              "Value": "US",
              "ExternalValue": null,
              "Description": null
            },
            {
              "Id": "Untitled Example2",
              "Name": null,
              "Value": "CA",
              "ExternalValue": null,
              "Description": null
            }
          ],
          "example": "US",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "paypal_email": {
          "description": "The PayPal account that gets paid, if the seller doesn't connect one with `connectPayPal`.",
          "example": "seller@example.com",
          "type": "string",
          "format": "email"
        },
        "seller_email": {
          "description": "Where order notifications go.",
          "example": "seller@example.com",
          "type": "string",
          "format": "email"
        },
        "digital_file": {
          "description": "Digital products sold as a file: the file buyers download, up to 25 MB. Can also be added later with `uploadDigitalFile`.",
          "type": "string",
          "format": "data-url"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "source"
      ]
    }
- CreatedShop: |
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
      "id": "CreatedShop",
      "title": "CreatedShop",
      "description": "The new draft shop and the credentials to manage it.",
      "example": {
        "slug": "dragonflight",
        "token": "3fJ9xQm2LwP8vR1tZk7cN4bY6dHs0aEu",
        "manageUrl": "/manage/vintageskates?token=3fJ9xQm2LwP8vR1tZk7cN4bY6dHs0aEu"
      },
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "slug": {
          "description": "The shop's link name: the page is `https://<host>/<slug>`.",
          "example": "dragonflight",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "token": {
          "description": "The admin token. Shown once; store it.",
          "example": "3fJ9xQm2LwP8vR1tZk7cN4bY6dHs0aEu",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "manageUrl": {
          "description": "The seller's private manage page (contains the token).",
          "example": "/manage/vintageskates?token=3fJ9xQm2LwP8vR1tZk7cN4bY6dHs0aEu",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "slug",
        "token",
        "manageUrl"
      ]
    }
- ShopUpdate: |
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
      "id": "ShopUpdate",
      "title": "ShopUpdate",
      "description": "The fields to change. Anything left out stays as it is.",
      "example": {
        "slug": "vintageskates",
        "status": "draft",
        "product_type": "physical",
        "price": 240,
        "shipping": 15,
        "stock": 7,
        "ship_countries": "US,CA",
        "delivery": "file",
        "access_url": "https://www.miriogames.com/raptor-rush/",
        "paypal_email": "seller@example.com",
        "seller_email": "seller@example.com",
        "zapier_hook_url": "https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/123456/abcdef/",
        "in_gallery": true,
        "options": [
          {
            "name": "Size",
            "kind": "size",
            "values": [
              {
                "label": "S"
              },
              {
                "label": "M"
              },
              {
                "label": "L"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "option_stock": {
          "M / Black": 4,
          "L / Black": 0
        },
        "facts": [
          {
            "label": "Size",
            "value": "US women's 8"
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "slug": {
          "description": "A new link name. The old one keeps redirecting.",
          "example": "vintageskates",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "title": "Status",
          "description": "`live` publishes the shop; `draft` takes it down.",
          "example": "draft",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "draft",
            "live"
          ]
        },
        "product_type": {
          "title": "ProductType",
          "description": "`referral` only for shops created from Channel3.",
          "example": "physical",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "physical",
            "digital",
            "referral"
          ]
        },
        "price": {
          "description": "The price in USD.",
          "example": 240,
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0.5,
          "maximum": 10000.0
        },
        "shipping": {
          "description": "Shipping per order, in USD.",
          "example": 15,
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "maximum": 500.0
        },
        "stock": {
          "description": "How many are for sale; null for unlimited.",
          "example": 7,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "format": "int32"
        },
        "ship_countries": {
          "description": "Comma-separated ISO country codes; null or empty means anywhere PayPal ships.",
          "example": "US,CA",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "delivery": {
          "title": "Delivery1",
          "description": "Digital products: `file` or `access_code`.",
          "example": "file",
          "type": "string",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "enum": [
            "file",
            "access_code"
          ]
        },
        "access_url": {
          "description": "Access-code products: where buyers enter their code.",
          "example": "https://www.miriogames.com/raptor-rush/",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "uri"
        },
        "paypal_email": {
          "description": "The PayPal account paid when no account is connected.",
          "example": "seller@example.com",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "email"
        },
        "seller_email": {
          "description": "Where order notifications go.",
          "example": "seller@example.com",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "email"
        },
        "zapier_hook_url": {
          "description": "A Zapier Catch Hook for order events; null removes it.",
          "example": "https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/123456/abcdef/",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "format": "uri"
        },
        "in_gallery": {
          "description": "Feature the shop at `/gallery` while it's live. Off by default.",
          "example": true,
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "options": {
          "description": "What the buyer picks (physical products only), replacing the current options; `[]` removes them. With options, stock is counted per combination in `option_stock` and the shop's own `stock` is cleared. At most 60 combinations.",
          "example": [
            {
              "name": "Size",
              "kind": "size",
              "values": [
                {
                  "label": "S"
                },
                {
                  "label": "M"
                },
                {
                  "label": "L"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "id": "ShopOption",
            "title": "ShopOption",
            "description": "Something the buyer picks, such as a size or a colour. The shop still sells one product.",
            "example": {
              "name": "Size",
              "kind": "size",
              "values": [
                {
                  "label": "S"
                },
                {
                  "label": "M"
                },
                {
                  "label": "L"
                }
              ]
            },
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "description": "What the buyer is choosing.",
                "example": "Size",
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 20
              },
              "kind": {
                "title": "Kind",
                "description": "`color` shows swatches, and the photo of the picked colour.",
                "example": "size",
                "type": "string",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "enum": [
                  "size",
                  "color",
                  "other"
                ]
              },
              "values": {
                "description": "The values to pick from.",
                "example": [
                  {
                    "label": "S"
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "M"
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "L"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "id": "OptionValue",
                  "title": "OptionValue",
                  "description": "One value of an option.",
                  "example": {
                    "label": "M",
                    "hex": "#14171a",
                    "photo": "zrySajNyao6_j11x"
                  },
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "label": {
                      "description": "What the buyer sees and picks.",
                      "example": "M",
                      "type": "string",
                      "maxLength": 30
                    },
                    "hex": {
                      "description": "A colour as `#rrggbb`.",
                      "example": "#14171a",
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                    },
                    "photo": {
                      "description": "Colours: the shop photo (id) that shows this colour. See `matchColorPhotos`.",
                      "example": "zrySajNyao6_j11x",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "label"
                  ]
                },
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 12
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "name",
              "kind",
              "values"
            ]
          },
          "maxItems": 3
        },
        "option_stock": {
          "description": "Stock per combination, keyed by its values in option order joined with ` / ` (e.g. `M / Black`). A missing key or `null` means unlimited; `0` is sold out.",
          "example": {
            "M / Black": 4,
            "L / Black": 0
          },
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "minimum": 0.0
        },
        "facts": {
          "description": "Answers to the \"buyers will ask\" questions in `suggestions.missingFacts`. Each becomes a product detail on the page (replacing one with the same label) and drops off the list.",
          "example": [
            {
              "label": "Size",
              "value": "US women's 8"
            }
          ],
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "id": "Fact",
            "title": "Fact",
            "description": "One answered question.",
            "example": {
              "label": "Size",
              "value": "US women's 8"
            },
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "label": {
                "description": "The detail's label.",
                "example": "Size",
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 30
              },
              "value": {
                "description": "The answer.",
                "example": "US women's 8",
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 100
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "label",
              "value"
            ]
          },
          "maxItems": 5
        }
      }
    }
- Shop: "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"id\": \"Shop\",\n  \"title\": \"Shop\",\n  \"description\": \"A shop, as its seller sees it.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\": {\n      \"description\": \"OneThing's internal shop id.\",\n      \"example\": \"shp_8Hc2LmQ4\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"slug\": {\n      \"description\": \"The shop's link name.\",\n      \"example\": \"vintageskates\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"title\": \"Status1\",\n      \"description\": \"`draft` until the seller goes live; only `live` shops take orders.\",\n      \"example\": \"draft\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"draft\",\n        \"live\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"product_type\": {\n      \"title\": \"ProductType1\",\n      \"description\": \"`physical` ships, `digital` downloads or unlocks, `referral` recommends a Channel3 product.\",\n      \"example\": \"physical\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"physical\",\n        \"digital\",\n        \"referral\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"price_cents\": {\n      \"description\": \"The price in cents.\",\n      \"example\": 24000,\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"format\": \"int32\"\n    },\n    \"currency\": {\n      \"description\": \"ISO 4217 currency code.\",\n      \"example\": \"USD\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"spec\": {\n      \"id\": \"DesignSpec\",\n      \"title\": \"DesignSpec\",\n      \"description\": \"What Gemini designed. OneThing's templates render it; Gemini never writes HTML.\",\n      \"example\": {\n        \"productType\": \"physical\",\n        \"productName\": \"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\",\n        \"layout\": \"bold-hero\",\n        \"palette\": {\n          \"background\": \"#f7f1e8\",\n          \"surface\": \"#ffffff\",\n          \"text\": \"#1f1a17\",\n          \"muted\": \"#6b625b\",\n          \"accent\": \"#b3262d\",\n          \"accentText\": \"#ffffff\"\n        },\n        \"fonts\": {\n          \"heading\": \"Playfair Display\",\n          \"body\": \"Inter\"\n        },\n        \"eyebrow\": \"One pair, restored\",\n        \"headline\": \"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\",\n        \"subheadline\": \"A vintage pair of skates with cream leather, bold red trim and quad wheels.\",\n        \"story\": \"Each pair combines soft cream leather with distinct red accents and a sculpted walnut burl heel base.\",\n        \"bullets\": [\n          \"Walnut burl heels\",\n          \"Restored vintage leather\"\n        ],\n        \"details\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Material\",\n            \"value\": \"Leather upper, walnut burl heel, rubber wheels\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"faq\": [\n          {\n            \"q\": \"Are these suitable for outdoor skating?\",\n            \"a\": \"Yes, on indoor rink floors and paved outdoor paths.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"ctaLabel\": \"Buy the skates\",\n        \"suggestedPriceUsd\": 240,\n        \"suggestedShippingUsd\": 15,\n        \"imageAlt\": \"Cream leather quad roller skates with red trim\",\n        \"heroPrompt\": \"Cream roller skates on a sunlit boardwalk, in warm cream and red tones\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"productType\": {\n          \"title\": \"ProductType2\",\n          \"description\": \"What the AI decided the product is.\",\n          \"example\": \"physical\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"additionalProperties\": false,\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"digital\",\n            \"physical\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"productName\": {\n          \"description\": \"The product's name.\",\n          \"example\": \"Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"layout\": {\n          \"title\": \"Layout\",\n          \"description\": \"The page template: `bold-hero` (image first, punchy), `editorial` (magazine), `minimal` (quiet, lots of space) or `playful`.\",\n          \"example\": \"bold-hero\",\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"additionalProperties\": false,\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"bold-hero\",\n            \"editorial\",\n            \"minimal\",\n            \"playful\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"palette\": {\n          \"id\": \"Palette\",\n          \"title\": \"Palette\",\n          \"description\": \"The page colours, taken from the photo. Text colours are checked for contrast.\",\n          \"example\": {\n            \"background\": \"#f7f1e8\",\n            \"surface\": \"#ffffff\",\n            \"text\": \"#1f1a17\",\n            \"muted\": \"#6b625b\",\n            \"accent\": \"#b3262d\",\n            \"accentText\": \"#ffffff\"\n          },\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"background\": {\n              \"description\": \"A colour as `#rrggbb`.\",\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            },\n            \"surface\": {\n              \"description\": \"A colour as `#rrggbb`.\",\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            },\n            \"text\": {\n              \"description\": \"A colour as `#rrggbb`.\",\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            },\n            \"muted\": {\n              \"description\": \"A colour as `#rrggbb`.\",\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            },\n            \"accent\": {\n              \"description\": \"A colour as `#rrggbb`.\",\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            },\n            \"accentText\": {\n              \"description\": \"A colour as `#rrggbb`.\",\n              \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"background\",\n            \"surface\",\n            \"text\",\n            \"muted\",\n            \"accent\",\n            \"accentText\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"fonts\": {\n          \"id\": \"Fonts\",\n          \"title\": \"Fonts\",\n          \"description\": \"Google Fonts for the page.\",\n          \"example\": {\n            \"heading\": \"Playfair Display\",\n            \"body\": \"Inter\"\n          },\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"heading\": {\n              \"description\": \"The headings font.\",\n              \"example\": \"Playfair Display\",\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"body\": {\n              \"description\": \"The body text font.\",\n              \"example\": \"Inter\",\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"heading\",\n            \"body\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"headline\": {\n          \"description\": \"The page's main headline.\",\n          \"example\": \"Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"bullets\": {\n          \"description\": \"Short selling points.\",\n          \"example\": [\n            \"Walnut burl heels\",\n            \"Restored vintage leather\"\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"faq\": {\n          \"description\": \"Questions buyers will ask, with answers.\",\n          \"example\": [\n            {\n              \"q\": \"Are these suitable for outdoor skating?\",\n              \"a\": \"Yes, on indoor rink floors and paved outdoor paths.\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"id\": \"Faq\",\n            \"title\": \"Faq\",\n            \"description\": \"One question and its answer.\",\n            \"example\": {\n              \"q\": \"Are these suitable for outdoor skating?\",\n              \"a\": \"Yes, on indoor rink floors and paved outdoor paths.\"\n            },\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"q\": {\n                \"description\": \"The question.\",\n                \"example\": \"Are these suitable for outdoor skating?\",\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              \"a\": {\n                \"description\": \"The answer.\",\n                \"example\": \"Yes, on indoor rink floors and paved outdoor paths.\",\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"q\",\n              \"a\"\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"ctaLabel\": {\n          \"description\": \"The buy button's text.\",\n          \"example\": \"Buy the skates\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"eyebrow\": {\n          \"description\": \"A short label above the headline.\",\n          \"example\": \"One pair, restored\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"subheadline\": {\n          \"description\": \"A line under the headline.\",\n          \"example\": \"A vintage pair of skates with cream leather, bold red trim and quad wheels.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"story\": {\n          \"description\": \"A short paragraph about the product.\",\n          \"example\": \"Each pair combines soft cream leather with distinct red accents and a sculpted walnut burl heel base.\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"details\": {\n          \"description\": \"Product facts shown on the page.\",\n          \"example\": [\n            {\n              \"label\": \"Material\",\n              \"value\": \"Leather upper, walnut burl heel, rubber wheels\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"id\": \"Detail\",\n            \"title\": \"Detail\",\n            \"description\": \"One product fact.\",\n            \"example\": {\n              \"label\": \"Material\",\n              \"value\": \"Leather upper, walnut burl heel, rubber wheels\"\n            },\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"label\": {\n                \"description\": \"What the fact is about.\",\n                \"example\": \"Material\",\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              },\n              \"value\": {\n                \"description\": \"The fact.\",\n                \"example\": \"Leather upper, walnut burl heel, rubber wheels\",\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"label\",\n              \"value\"\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"suggestedPriceUsd\": {\n          \"description\": \"The AI's price suggestion, in USD.\",\n          \"example\": 240,\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"suggestedShippingUsd\": {\n          \"description\": \"The AI's shipping suggestion, in USD.\",\n          \"example\": 15,\n          \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"imageAlt\": {\n          \"description\": \"Alt text for the product photo.\",\n          \"example\": \"Cream leather quad roller skates with red trim\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"heroPrompt\": {\n          \"description\": \"The prompt used to generate hero art for the page.\",\n          \"example\": \"Cream roller skates on a sunlit boardwalk, in warm cream and red tones\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"productType\",\n        \"productName\",\n        \"layout\",\n        \"palette\",\n        \"fonts\",\n        \"headline\",\n        \"bullets\",\n        \"faq\",\n        \"ctaLabel\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"shipping_cents\": {\n      \"description\": \"Shipping per order, in cents.\",\n      \"example\": 1500,\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"format\": \"int32\"\n    },\n    \"ship_countries\": {\n      \"description\": \"Comma-separated ISO country codes; null or empty means anywhere PayPal ships.\",\n      \"example\": \"US,CA\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"stock\": {\n      \"description\": \"How many are left; null for unlimited. With options, see `option_stock`.\",\n      \"example\": 7,\n      \"type\": [\n        \"integer\",\n        \"null\"\n      ],\n      \"format\": \"int32\"\n    },\n    \"delivery\": {\n      \"title\": \"Delivery2\",\n      \"description\": \"Digital products: `file` (a download) or `access_code` (a code that unlocks an app or game).\",\n      \"example\": \"file\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"file\",\n        \"access_code\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"access_url\": {\n      \"description\": \"Access-code products: where buyers enter their code.\",\n      \"example\": \"https://www.miriogames.com/raptor-rush/\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"paypal_email\": {\n      \"description\": \"The PayPal account paid when no account is connected.\",\n      \"example\": \"seller@example.com\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"seller_email\": {\n      \"description\": \"Where order notifications go.\",\n      \"example\": \"seller@example.com\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"paypal_merchant_id\": {\n      \"description\": \"The connected PayPal account (`connectPayPal`). Sales go here when it can receive payments.\",\n      \"example\": \"7MZJ4QXN8K2LA\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"paypal_status\": {\n      \"description\": \"What PayPal last said about the connected account; null when none is connected.\",\n      \"example\": {\n        \"receivable\": true,\n        \"emailConfirmed\": true,\n        \"checkedAt\": \"2026-10-22T02:41:37Z\"\n      },\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"PayPalStatus\",\n          \"title\": \"PayPalStatus\",\n          \"description\": \"What PayPal last said about a connected seller account.\",\n          \"example\": {\n            \"receivable\": true,\n            \"emailConfirmed\": true,\n            \"checkedAt\": \"2026-10-22T02:41:37Z\"\n          },\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"receivable\": {\n              \"description\": \"The account can receive payments.\",\n              \"example\": true,\n              \"type\": \"boolean\"\n            },\n            \"emailConfirmed\": {\n              \"description\": \"The seller has confirmed their email with PayPal.\",\n              \"example\": true,\n              \"type\": \"boolean\"\n            },\n            \"checkedAt\": {\n              \"description\": \"When OneThing last asked PayPal.\",\n              \"example\": \"2026-10-22T02:41:37Z\",\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"format\": \"date-time\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"receivable\",\n            \"emailConfirmed\",\n            \"checkedAt\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"zapier_hook_url\": {\n      \"description\": \"A Zapier Catch Hook that gets an `OrderEvent` for each paid, shipped or refunded order.\",\n      \"example\": \"https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/123456/abcdef/\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"in_gallery\": {\n      \"description\": \"Whether the shop is featured at `/gallery` while live.\",\n      \"example\": true,\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"account_id\": {\n      \"description\": \"The seller account that owns the shop, if it was made while signed in.\",\n      \"example\": \"acc_Vq3nN8cT0bLx2YwE\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"options\": {\n      \"description\": \"What the buyer picks, such as size or colour.\",\n      \"example\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Size\",\n          \"kind\": \"size\",\n          \"values\": [\n            {\n              \"label\": \"S\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"label\": \"M\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"label\": \"L\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"id\": \"ShopOption\",\n        \"title\": \"ShopOption\",\n        \"description\": \"Something the buyer picks, such as a size or a colour. The shop still sells one product.\",\n        \"example\": {\n          \"name\": \"Size\",\n          \"kind\": \"size\",\n          \"values\": [\n            {\n              \"label\": \"S\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"label\": \"M\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"label\": \"L\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"name\": {\n            \"description\": \"What the buyer is choosing.\",\n            \"example\": \"Size\",\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"maxLength\": 20\n          },\n          \"kind\": {\n            \"title\": \"Kind\",\n            \"description\": \"`color` shows swatches, and the photo of the picked colour.\",\n            \"example\": \"size\",\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": false,\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"size\",\n              \"color\",\n              \"other\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"values\": {\n            \"description\": \"The values to pick from.\",\n            \"example\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"S\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"M\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"L\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"id\": \"OptionValue\",\n              \"title\": \"OptionValue\",\n              \"description\": \"One value of an option.\",\n              \"example\": {\n                \"label\": \"M\",\n                \"hex\": \"#14171a\",\n                \"photo\": \"zrySajNyao6_j11x\"\n              },\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"label\": {\n                  \"description\": \"What the buyer sees and picks.\",\n                  \"example\": \"M\",\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"maxLength\": 30\n                },\n                \"hex\": {\n                  \"description\": \"A colour as `#rrggbb`.\",\n                  \"example\": \"#14171a\",\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"pattern\": \"^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$\"\n                },\n                \"photo\": {\n                  \"description\": \"Colours: the shop photo (id) that shows this colour. See `matchColorPhotos`.\",\n                  \"example\": \"zrySajNyao6_j11x\",\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"label\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"minItems\": 1,\n            \"maxItems\": 12\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"name\",\n          \"kind\",\n          \"values\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"option_stock\": {\n      \"description\": \"Stock per combination, keyed by its values in option order joined with ` / ` (e.g. `M / Black`). A missing key or `null` means unlimited; `0` is sold out.\",\n      \"example\": {\n        \"M / Black\": 4,\n        \"L / Black\": 0\n      },\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": {\n        \"type\": [\n          \"integer\",\n          \"null\"\n        ],\n        \"format\": \"int32\"\n      },\n      \"minimum\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"suggestions\": {\n      \"description\": \"What the AI thinks buyers will pick or ask; null once handled.\",\n      \"example\": {\n        \"oneOfAKind\": false,\n        \"options\": [\n          {\n            \"name\": \"Size\",\n            \"kind\": \"size\",\n            \"values\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"S\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"M\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"L\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"missingFacts\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Size\",\n            \"question\": \"What size are the skates?\",\n            \"placeholder\": \"US women's 8\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"Suggestions\",\n          \"title\": \"Suggestions\",\n          \"description\": \"What Gemini thinks buyers will want to choose or ask. The seller confirms; nothing is applied on its own.\",\n          \"example\": {\n            \"oneOfAKind\": false,\n            \"options\": [\n              {\n                \"name\": \"Size\",\n                \"kind\": \"size\",\n                \"values\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"S\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"M\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"L\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              }\n            ],\n            \"missingFacts\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Size\",\n                \"question\": \"What size are the skates?\",\n                \"placeholder\": \"US women's 8\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"oneOfAKind\": {\n              \"description\": \"A single item (vintage, handmade), so options and stock don't apply.\",\n              \"example\": false,\n              \"type\": \"boolean\"\n            },\n            \"options\": {\n              \"description\": \"Options buyers will likely want to pick.\",\n              \"example\": [\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"Size\",\n                  \"kind\": \"size\",\n                  \"values\": [\n                    {\n                      \"label\": \"S\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"label\": \"M\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"label\": \"L\"\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ],\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": {\n                \"id\": \"Option\",\n                \"title\": \"Option\",\n                \"description\": \"A suggested option.\",\n                \"example\": {\n                  \"name\": \"Size\",\n                  \"kind\": \"size\",\n                  \"values\": [\n                    {\n                      \"label\": \"S\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"label\": \"M\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"label\": \"L\"\n                    }\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"name\": {\n                    \"description\": \"What the buyer is choosing.\",\n                    \"example\": \"Size\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"maxLength\": 20\n                  },\n                  \"kind\": {\n                    \"$ref\": \"ShopOption#/properties/kind\"\n                  },\n                  \"values\": {\n                    \"description\": \"The values to pick from.\",\n                    \"example\": [\n                      {\n                        \"label\": \"S\"\n                      },\n                      {\n                        \"label\": \"M\"\n                      },\n                      {\n                        \"label\": \"L\"\n                      }\n                    ],\n                    \"type\": \"array\",\n                    \"items\": {\n                      \"$ref\": \"OptionValue\"\n                    },\n                    \"minItems\": 1,\n                    \"maxItems\": 12\n                  },\n                  \"fromSeller\": {\n                    \"description\": \"The seller's description or photo named these values; otherwise they're a guess.\",\n                    \"example\": false,\n                    \"type\": \"boolean\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"name\",\n                  \"kind\",\n                  \"values\"\n                ]\n              }\n            },\n            \"missingFacts\": {\n              \"description\": \"Questions buyers will ask that the listing doesn't answer yet.\",\n              \"example\": [\n                {\n                  \"label\": \"Size\",\n                  \"question\": \"What size are the skates?\",\n                  \"placeholder\": \"US women's 8\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": {\n                \"id\": \"MissingFact\",\n                \"title\": \"MissingFact\",\n                \"description\": \"One question to answer.\",\n                \"example\": {\n                  \"label\": \"Size\",\n                  \"question\": \"What size are the skates?\",\n                  \"placeholder\": \"US women's 8\"\n                },\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"label\": {\n                    \"description\": \"The product detail it becomes.\",\n                    \"example\": \"Size\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"question\": {\n                    \"description\": \"The question, for the seller.\",\n                    \"example\": \"What size are the skates?\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"placeholder\": {\n                    \"description\": \"An example answer.\",\n                    \"example\": \"US women's 8\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"label\",\n                  \"question\",\n                  \"placeholder\"\n                ]\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"oneOfAKind\",\n            \"options\",\n            \"missingFacts\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"photo_blob\": {\n      \"description\": \"Image id for `getImage`. The cover photo.\",\n      \"example\": \"LFRvGuTU3D8i334X\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"gallery_blobs\": {\n      \"description\": \"The other photos, in order.\",\n      \"example\": [\n        \"zrySajNyao6_j11x\",\n        \"SuqcgNv64HWN8H6e\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"hero_blob\": {\n      \"description\": \"Image id of the AI hero art, when there is one.\",\n      \"example\": \"Hn2Kd8sQp4LmZ0vX\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"hero_status\": {\n      \"title\": \"HeroStatus\",\n      \"description\": \"Hero art: `pending` while generating, then `ready` or `failed`; `none` if not requested.\",\n      \"example\": \"none\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"none\",\n        \"pending\",\n        \"ready\",\n        \"failed\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"hero_error\": {\n      \"description\": \"Why hero art failed, when it did.\",\n      \"example\": \"No image model on this key returned an image.\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"ai_source\": {\n      \"title\": \"AiSource\",\n      \"description\": \"Who designed the page: `gemini`, or `fallback` when Gemini wasn't available and a plain template was used.\",\n      \"example\": \"gemini\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"gemini\",\n        \"fallback\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"source_url\": {\n      \"description\": \"The product link the shop was made from, if any.\",\n      \"example\": \"https://example.com/products/roller-skates\",\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"referral\": {\n      \"description\": \"Recommendation shops: the Channel3 product; null otherwise.\",\n      \"example\": {\n        \"productId\": \"ch3_7f2a9c1e\",\n        \"title\": \"Trail Running Vest 5L\",\n        \"brand\": \"Salomon\",\n        \"image\": \"https://images.example.com/vest.jpg\",\n        \"offers\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"rei.com\",\n            \"url\": \"https://buy.trychannel3.com/r/abc123\",\n            \"price\": 240,\n            \"currency\": \"USD\",\n            \"inStock\": true,\n            \"commission\": 0.08\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"Referral\",\n          \"title\": \"Referral\",\n          \"description\": \"A recommended Channel3 product. Buy links are Channel3-tracked, credited to this shop.\",\n          \"example\": {\n            \"productId\": \"ch3_7f2a9c1e\",\n            \"title\": \"Trail Running Vest 5L\",\n            \"brand\": \"Salomon\",\n            \"image\": \"https://images.example.com/vest.jpg\",\n            \"offers\": [\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"rei.com\",\n                \"url\": \"https://buy.trychannel3.com/r/abc123\",\n                \"price\": 240,\n                \"currency\": \"USD\",\n                \"inStock\": true,\n                \"commission\": 0.08\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"productId\": {\n              \"description\": \"Channel3's product id.\",\n              \"example\": \"ch3_7f2a9c1e\",\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"title\": {\n              \"description\": \"The product's name.\",\n              \"example\": \"Trail Running Vest 5L\",\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"offers\": {\n              \"description\": \"Stores that sell it, with tracked links.\",\n              \"example\": [\n                {\n                  \"domain\": \"rei.com\",\n                  \"url\": \"https://buy.trychannel3.com/r/abc123\",\n                  \"price\": 240,\n                  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n                  \"inStock\": true,\n                  \"commission\": 0.08\n                }\n              ],\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": {\n                \"id\": \"Offer\",\n                \"title\": \"Offer\",\n                \"description\": \"One store's offer.\",\n                \"example\": {\n                  \"domain\": \"rei.com\",\n                  \"url\": \"https://buy.trychannel3.com/r/abc123\",\n                  \"price\": 240,\n                  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n                  \"inStock\": true,\n                  \"commission\": 0.08\n                },\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"domain\": {\n                    \"description\": \"The store's domain.\",\n                    \"example\": \"rei.com\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"url\": {\n                    \"description\": \"A Channel3-tracked buy link, credited to this shop.\",\n                    \"example\": \"https://buy.trychannel3.com/r/abc123\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"price\": {\n                    \"description\": \"The store's price.\",\n                    \"example\": 240,\n                    \"type\": \"number\"\n                  },\n                  \"currency\": {\n                    \"description\": \"ISO 4217 currency code.\",\n                    \"example\": \"USD\",\n                    \"type\": \"string\"\n                  },\n                  \"inStock\": {\n                    \"description\": \"Whether the store has it in stock.\",\n                    \"example\": true,\n                    \"type\": \"boolean\"\n                  },\n                  \"commission\": {\n                    \"description\": \"Maximum commission rate, 0–1 (0.08 = 8%).\",\n                    \"example\": 0.08,\n                    \"type\": \"number\"\n                  }\n                },\n                \"required\": [\n                  \"domain\",\n                  \"url\",\n                  \"price\",\n                  \"currency\",\n                  \"inStock\",\n                  \"commission\"\n                ]\n              }\n            },\n            \"brand\": {\n              \"description\": \"The brand, when known.\",\n              \"example\": \"Salomon\",\n              \"type\": [\n                \"string\",\n                \"null\"\n              ]\n            },\n            \"image\": {\n              \"description\": \"The product image's URL.\",\n              \"example\": \"https://images.example.com/vest.jpg\",\n              \"type\": [\n                \"string\",\n                \"null\"\n              ]\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"productId\",\n            \"title\",\n            \"offers\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"created_at\": {\n      \"description\": \"When the shop was made.\",\n      \"example\": \"2026-10-22T02:41:37Z\",\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date-time\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"id\",\n    \"slug\",\n    \"status\",\n    \"product_type\",\n    \"price_cents\",\n    \"currency\",\n    \"spec\"\n  ]\n}"
- DesignSpec: |
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
      "id": "DesignSpec",
      "title": "DesignSpec",
      "description": "What Gemini designed. OneThing's templates render it; Gemini never writes HTML.",
      "example": {
        "productType": "physical",
        "productName": "Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates",
        "layout": "bold-hero",
        "palette": {
          "background": "#f7f1e8",
          "surface": "#ffffff",
          "text": "#1f1a17",
          "muted": "#6b625b",
          "accent": "#b3262d",
          "accentText": "#ffffff"
        },
        "fonts": {
          "heading": "Playfair Display",
          "body": "Inter"
        },
        "eyebrow": "One pair, restored",
        "headline": "Classic quad skates crafted with walnut burl heels",
        "subheadline": "A vintage pair of skates with cream leather, bold red trim and quad wheels.",
        "story": "Each pair combines soft cream leather with distinct red accents and a sculpted walnut burl heel base.",
        "bullets": [
          "Walnut burl heels",
          "Restored vintage leather"
        ],
        "details": [
          {
            "label": "Material",
            "value": "Leather upper, walnut burl heel, rubber wheels"
          }
        ],
        "faq": [
          {
            "q": "Are these suitable for outdoor skating?",
            "a": "Yes, on indoor rink floors and paved outdoor paths."
          }
        ],
        "ctaLabel": "Buy the skates",
        "suggestedPriceUsd": 240,
        "suggestedShippingUsd": 15,
        "imageAlt": "Cream leather quad roller skates with red trim",
        "heroPrompt": "Cream roller skates on a sunlit boardwalk, in warm cream and red tones"
      },
