nder.com/vintageskates\\\"}],\\\"agent_name\\\":\\\"Claude\\\"},\\\"isError\\\":false}}\",\n      \"ExternalValue\": null,\n      \"Description\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"Id\": \"order\",\n      \"Name\": \"create_order\",\n      \"Value\": \"{\\\"jsonrpc\\\":\\\"2.0\\\",\\\"id\\\":2,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"order_id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"awaiting_buyer_approval\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"total\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"$255.00\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"options\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Size\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"9\\\\\\\"\\\\n  },\\\\n  \\\\\\\"pay_url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"status_url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe/status\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"next_step\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Show pay_url to the buyer as a link. It opens PayPal, where they pay (and enter a shipping address for physical items). When they say they've paid, call get_order with order_id: it returns the access code, download link or shipping details.\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\"}],\\\"structuredContent\\\":{\\\"order_id\\\":\\\"pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"awaiting_buyer_approval\\\",\\\"total\\\":\\\"$255.00\\\",\\\"options\\\":{\\\"Size\\\":\\\"9\\\"},\\\"pay_url\\\":\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe\\\",\\\"status_url\\\":\\\"https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/o/pX4kR9tVb2nQ7sLe/status\\\",\\\"next_step\\\":\\\"Show pay_url to the buyer as a link. It opens PayPal, where they pay (and enter a shipping address for physical items). When they say they've paid, call get_order with order_id: it returns the access code, download link or shipping details.\\\"},\\\"isError\\\":false}}\",\n      \"ExternalValue\": null,\n      \"Description\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"Id\": \"status\",\n      \"Name\": \"get_order, paid\",\n      \"Value\": \"{\\\"jsonrpc\\\":\\\"